- Auto-load older commits when the list is scrolled to the bottom: loadCommits
  fetches m_commitsLimit(+1) records, flags m_commitsHasMore, and a scrollbar
  handler deepens the window via loadMoreCommits() while preserving scroll. The
  window resets to 300 only when the viewed branch changes.
- Multi-select commits (ExtendedSelection; a plain click still opens the diff),
  then "Generate post" composes a release-notes message and a ≤280-char X post
  from the selected commit subjects, shown in a copyable dialog.
- Newest-first ordering was already correct (Date column sorts on raw commit ts).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
